{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Embark on an unforgettable adventure in <i>GoopUp</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vibrant world filled with mysterious hats, each granting unique powers that unlock hidden pathways and help you overcome the world\u2019s obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with a friend to strategize and solve mind-bending puzzles woven into the fabric of <i>GoopUp's</i> world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/Recording_2025-03-08_132707.gif?t=1744620563\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hats with Powers</strong> \u2013 Discover and equip different hats to alter gameplay and reveal secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/Recording_2025-03-08_133255.gif?t=1744620563\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Movement</strong> \u2013 You can only move while airborne, adding a fresh but limiting twist to classic platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/Recording_2025-03-08_132452.gif?t=1744620563\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-op Puzzle Solving</strong> \u2013 Work together to navigate challenging levels and outsmart obstacles. <br><strong>Survive the Perils</strong> \u2013 Avoid spikes, water, and enemies\u2014losing all 4 hearts means <i>Game Over</i>. <br><strong>Diverse Level Design</strong> \u2013 Traverse eight expansive zones featuring horizontal and vertical sub-levels. <br><strong>Up to 2 Players</strong> \u2013 Bounce off each other to reach new heights and master cooperative movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do you have what it takes to master the world of <i>GoopUp</i>? Jump in to defeat the terrible king!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/PropagandaRebelPoster_1.png?t=1744620563\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582480?t=1744620563","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582480?t=1744620563","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/4e60d7a0d126eb82d93abd498314fb8470375509/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744620563","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/4e60d7a0d126eb82d93abd498314fb8470375509/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744620563","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Embark on an unforgettable adventure in <i>GoopUp</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vibrant world filled with mysterious hats, each granting unique powers that unlock hidden pathways and help you overcome the world\u2019s obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with a friend to strategize and solve mind-bending puzzles woven into the fabric of <i>GoopUp's</i> world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582480/extras/Recording_2025-03-08_132707.gif?t=1744620563\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">